### 3. **Handler Recreation Per Request** - [routing.handler.ts](c:\Work\Study\AI Copilot\AI_Adapter\openai-adapter\src\handlers\routing.handler.ts#L7-L44)
**Severity:** HIGH  
**Type:** Performance Bug

Creates **new handler function for EVERY request**:
```typescript
export function createRoutingHandler(config: AdapterConfig) {
  const passThroughHandler = createPassThroughHandler('responses', { config }); // ❌ Unused!

  return async (request, reply) => {
    // ...
    if (routingResult.decision === 'pass-through') {
      return createPassThroughHandler(endpoint, { config })(request, reply); // ❌ NEW handler per request!
    }
  };
}
```

**Fix:** Create handlers once, reuse. Pass endpoint dynamically or create both handlers upfront.

